    "title": "Adam Lindemann-Cox wins 15K at DINO Trail Run in Southwestway Park on Aug. 29, 2026",
    "text": "Adam Lindemann-Cox wins 15K at DINO Trail Run in Southwestway Park on Aug. 29, 2026\nAdam Lindemann-Cox took first in the 15K at DINO Trail Run - Southwestway Park on Aug. 29, 2026, finishing in 1:06:44.2, according to RunSignUp results.\nLindemann-Cox, listed as being from Carmel, Indiana, was the overall and fastest male finisher. Claire Betz was the fastest female, finishing in 1:28:20.25.\nMarco Bautista was second in 1:07:20.75, and Rick Cox placed third in 1:11:30.65.",
